WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:03,620
Zhang Jianguo, are you crazy?

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:05,020
Second uncle, it’s not like you don’t know

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:06,180
I'm just a second-rate guy

4
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:08,380
What does a second-rate guy know about rebelling against Tiangang and not rebelling against Tiangang?

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,260
I only know who told me not to play

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,660
I'll do it

7
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,660
When Zhang Jianguo goes crazy, he dares to use the knife on his second uncle

8
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,180
What do I, an outsider, mean?

9
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,860
It's better to mind your own business and talk about today's affairs.

10
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,660
After all, it was Zhang Tiezhu and his son who were at fault first

11
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,460
It has not yet been confirmed whether Zhang Jianguo is dead or not.

12
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,780
You dare to jump out and become a monster and eat Juehu. You deserve to build an army.

13
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:33,870
What kind of Jianguo is this cheating damaged goods?

14
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:35,230
What just happened was my uncle's fault.

15
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:39,190
Second uncle, I'm going to apologize to you. Why don't you move the knife away first? If you have something to say, let's talk it over, okay? Second uncle.

16
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:43,150
Do you still want the land deed of our house? No, no, no, no more.

17
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:44,350
My three ex-wives

18
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:45,950
Do you need to worry about it? No?

19
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:46,950
What happens to your family in the future?

20
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:47,990
It has nothing to do with our family anymore

21
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:51,670
He dares to be a monster again

22
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:58,440
The knife in my hand is not long-sighted Jianguo

23
00:00:58,440 --> 00:01:00,550
Why did you come back now?

24
00:01:00,550 --> 00:01:01,550
are you okay

25
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:04,190
Didn't you encounter any danger at sea?

26
00:01:04,190 --> 00:01:05,870
I came back late because I had nothing to do

27
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:07,510
It's because I got a lot of black eagles

28
00:01:07,510 --> 00:01:08,990
Going to sell fish wasted time

29
00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:11,920
What about your boat?

30
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:15,020
The boat has sailed to Bifengang

31
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:16,060
I'm really fine

32
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,260
Don't worry y'all

33
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:18,580
Who is worried about you?

34
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:19,700
The child is still at home

35
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:21,500
Go back quickly

36
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:22,620
Yes, you have to go home quickly

37
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:23,740
The typhoon is coming soon

38
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:25,100
It's not safe here

39
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:26,380
Distance from typhoon landing

40
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:32,550
At most, it will take less than half an hour. Jianguo

41
00:01:32,550 --> 00:01:35,230
How much did the black eagle you got sell for? One pound per pound.

42
00:01:35,230 --> 00:01:36,620
Strong winds and waves bring disaster

43
00:01:36,620 --> 00:01:38,340
I guess you must have gotten a lot of black eagles this time

44
00:01:38,340 --> 00:01:39,660
There is a hundred pounds, right?

45
00:01:39,660 --> 00:01:43,860
Almost

46
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:45,020
These people are testing

47
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:46,100
I can't tell the truth

48
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,660
But you don’t have to hide it completely.

49
00:01:47,660 --> 00:01:49,420
Now we need to let these people know

50
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,020
I, Zhang Jianguo, have changed my appearance

51
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:52,060
henceforth

52
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:53,220
Can support this family
